Killing a '''Fire Mage''' will make the player gain {{Reputation|Barbarian|5}} and lose {{Reputation|Mage|5}}, up to a limit of {{Reputation|Barbarian|0}} and {{Reputation|Mage|0}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Fire Mages''' only attack the player when provoked, or if they have less than {{Reputation|Mage|-1000}}. They have two attacks:<br>
*Shoot a beam of fire for 8 seconds, which deals large amounts of damage.
*Shoot a barrage of fire for 2 seconds, which deals large amounts of damage, but has a 3 second cooldown.
When neutral they hold nothing, but when provoked, they appear to hold {{Item|Enchanted Blaze Powder}}.

